    "enUS": {
      "description": "NO!!!!!\n\nTake it, take this comb away from me!\n\nI'm a monster, and no one will ever think me lovely again!",
      "dialogue": {
        "939ad6f79b6f840aaa2f": "NO!!!!!$B$BTake it, take this comb away from me!$B$BI'm a monster, and no one will ever think me lovely again!",
        "b1bd01ed1f41c56ebea9": "I sense that you have seen Blind Mary.  You have my Comb...?",
        "f4d0e4042a95a1a3d3cf": "I can make a spool of Ghost Hair Thread with this, and have a few strands to spare.  Here are some coins for those extra strands."
      },
      "summary": "Return the Ghost Hair Comb to Madame Eva in Darkshire.",
      "title": "Return the Comb",
